## AI Development Rules

- All forms must include client-side validation and clear error messages before submission.

- Reusable UI components should be created for repeated elements such as buttons, inputs, and toggles instead of duplicating code.

- Every new feature must include testing for important user interactions before considering the feature complete.

- Components should follow the existing project structure and styling conventions.

- Interactive elements must include accessibility support such as proper labels and keyboard navigation.